data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":965,"item_id":"msg_0d663d64e2a7e6b5016b06b4d6556487d187e483882630de7c","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"lin\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"reuse\\\",\\\"ability\\\":\\\"probe\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The existing probe operation directly covers feasible non-ingestive examination and small physical trials of an owned sample. Its observe, press, wet and heat arguments already provide general assessment modes; a new food-assessment capability would duplicate that function. The related-capability search and retrieved probe contract support reuse. The requested outcome explicitly permits unresolved uncertainty, so an observation yielding no evidence about safety or nutrition is a valid limited result, not grounds to invent an assay. Collection has already succeeded: the supplied ownership record contains two hazelnut units.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Reuse probe, equivalence open-baseline:probe:1, handler open.probe, revision foundation-open@1; do not register a replacement or claim reinvention. Use its existing schema: target string (maximum 360 characters), mode observe|press|wet|heat, intensity number from 0 to 1, with no additional parameters. First executable action: target=item-19-lin-197, mode=observe, intensity=0, provided the actual owned stack is visible and within the handler's physical interaction range. Recheck ownership, accessibility, remaining quantity and condition at execution; ownership alone does not establish reach. The stack was harvested at tick 19 from start-1-nuts and contains two units; the old tick-15 observation is not a current stock measurement. Observation requires no additional supplied tool or consumable, takes one round and costs 0.2 energy. Report only externally observable features actually supported by the simulation, explicitly recording unavailable or inconclusive observations. No tasting or ingestion is part of this procedure. A later physical trial is a separate probe invocation costing one round, 0.5 energy and 0.1 unit from the actual selected sample. Choose a mode only when its real physical prerequisites and supported effect are present: no water, heat source, tool, analytical instrument or external reference is granted. In particular, wet and heat cannot create their required material or energy source. Press may be attempted only to the extent actual manual force and the existing handler support it; a resistant shell is an informative limitation, not automatic access to a kernel. Record any consumed sample allocation and any real transformed material or residue without duplication; retained stock continues ageing, and no edible product or treatment is credited unless actually produced. Use only the existing handler's measurable effects; this reuse adds no cracking, cooking, toxicity assay or nutrient assay mechanism. Compare observations with lin's retained knowledge, distinguishing the personal berry record from evidence about this sample. Appearance, resemblance, pressing response or absence of visible spoilage cannot establish edibility, absence of toxins, nutritional value or a required processing recipe. Keep all unsupported properties unknown. Each action is the existing one-round interaction, with interruption=cancel and no resumable partial mastery or trial progress; another attempt is a new paid interaction. Apply the existing handler's transaction rules to interruption, cancellation or death: never award completion for an unfinished interaction, never duplicate inputs, and never refund costs already spent. Unspent or unconsumed owned material remains subject to ordinary inventory and death rules. There is no continuing assessment process, maintenance obligation or automatic future testing. Development/review waiting advances no time. Findings require actual observations, not this review.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":0,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Reuse grants no learning, mastery, pleasure, satisfaction or nutrition. A completed observation or physical trial may qualify as verified information gain only when its actual event establishes new evidence or an informative limitation applicable to lin. A query, request, repeated unchanged observation or unsupported safety conclusion does not qualify. Any benefit must use established executable reward rules with functional deduplication, a bounded amount and cap, decay and cooldown; absent such an applicable rule, award none rather than invent a reward. Legitimate repeated practice may support only an already-defined modest maintenance benefit. No reward account, budget, goal or permission changes; no mood-based reduction of basic nutrition and no physical-comfort benefit from this assessment.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse the existing probe interaction visuals and observable events. Reference the actual sample ID, selected mode, location, duration, completion or cancellation status, consumed quantity and any observed physical change in reusable event/visual metadata. Show examination or an attempted physical trial only when it actually occurs. Findings may be labelled observed, inconclusive or unresolved; do not show safe-food, cooked, detoxified, nutritious or successful-shell-opening imagery unless that specific real effect is established. An interrupted or failed attempt may display its actual attempt or failure, never a success marker. No new catalogue interface or visual event is presumed to exist merely because this review approved reuse.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

